{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-reem-hills-villas","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"reem-hills-villas-q-properties-al-reem-island","about":"Reem Hills Villas is a family residential development developed by Q Properties on Al Reem Island in Abu Dhabi. The project is a perfect blend of sophistication, coziness and comfort. Located in a picturesque area of the city, the complex provides a high standard of living for its residents.Reem Hills Villas is a collection of modern and stylish 5-7 bedroom villas with luxurious design and high quality standards. Each villa is designed to maximize resident comfort and convenience, providing spacious and bright spaces, high quality finishes and state-of-the-art equipment.Residents of Reem Hills Villas can enjoy unique views of the surrounding nature while relaxing on spacious terraces or in their own private gardens. In addition, the complex offers a wide range of amenities such as swimming pool, fitness center, recreational areas and playgrounds.Modern security technologies, 24-hour security and well-maintained green areas make living in this complex carefree and cozy.The Rim Island neighborhood is amazing in its variety of opportunities catering to different needs and lifestyles. Premium shopping centers, institutions and infrastructure are close by. Yas Mall and Abu Dhabi International Airport are 20 minutes away, The Corniche waterfront is 10 minutes away and Abu Dhabi Global Market is 8 minutes away.Payment plan is under approval, please contact the manager for payment schedule questions.","price":11710300,"title":"Reem Hills Villas","bitrix":{"id":973,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"Reem Hills Villas","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Reem Hills Villas","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"Q Properties","project_location":"Al Reem Island"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/801/